      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It will not \"stop ripperstore in its tracks\" as if something has been encrypted it can always be decrypted.\n\nIf someone can see something then they can rip it.\n\nThe avatar's data has been downloaded to their device and unpacked so it can be displayed, this means that they have the files of the avatar stored in some way, whether it be on their device's storage or just in memory, either of these places can have data \"stolen\" from them.\n\nEncryption doesn't make it impossible to rip avatars, just a little bit more difficult.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-31T02:06:21.597Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It isn't that hard to do. Chillout has it, and it'll stop ripperstore in it's tracks.",
